      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m so worried about my house.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLeaving Arctibax home alone... Everything is\nprobably frozen solid by now!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
