      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, great! Here are the prices—make sure you\nmemorize them!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nFresh Water is <U+E300>200, Soda Pop is <U+E300>300,\nLemonade is <U+E300>400, and Moomoo Milk is <U+E300>600.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDon’t worry, I’ll be back soon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
