    {
      "displayText": "That’ll be <U+E300>49,700",
      "escapedControlUnits": 1,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 5752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006100742019006C006C0020006200650020E30000340039002C0037003000300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whoa, looks like we’ve got a math whiz over here!\nI’ll be back, so keep those counting skills sharp!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 5792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I would’ve paid full price, y’know! I’ll be back, so\nsharpen up those math skills till then!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 5996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m back! Thanks for looking after the kiosk while\nI was gone.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 6184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D0020006200610063006B00210020005400680061006E006B007300200066006F00720020006C006F006F006B0069006E006700200061006600740065007200200074006800650020006B0069006F0073006B0020007700680069006C0065000A0049002000770061007300200067006F006E0065002E00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s do a cash count, shall we?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 6320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200064006F002000610020006300610073006800200063006F0075006E0074002C0020007300680061006C006C002000770065003F00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maybe you aren’t cut out for retail. You’re Rank Z\nin my books...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 6396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100790062006500200079006F00750020006100720065006E2019007400200063007500740020006F0075007400200066006F0072002000720065007400610069006C002E00200059006F0075201900720065002000520061006E006B0020005A000A0069006E0020006D007900200062006F006F006B0073002E002E002E00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm... Maybe I should’ve trained you before\nasking you to take on so much responsibility...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 6536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Running a kiosk is no joke, huh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 6728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520075006E006E0069006E0067002000610020006B0069006F0073006B0020006900730020006E006F0020006A006F006B0065002C0020006800750068003F00100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You did an average job, I guess. Not bad! Not\namazing either, but that’s fine.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 6804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Looks like I left the kiosk in great hands!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 6972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006F006F006B00730020006C0069006B0065002000490020006C00650066007400200074006800650020006B0069006F0073006B00200069006E002000670072006500610074002000680061006E00640073002100100002011401C20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whoaaa! Nice clerking! Looks like I’ve got a retail\nrival in the making!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 7068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received <U+E300><U+0010><U+0003>Ȅ<U+0002><U+0000> as a bonus!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 7224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007200650063006500690076006500640020E300001000030204000200000020006100730020006100200062006F006E0075007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Arctibax was practically turning my house into a\nfridge. Glad I went back to check.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 7288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks for watching the kiosk! I hope you come\nback as a customer next time!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǂ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 7464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you want to take a moment to check the prices\nof the items?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 7628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00200079006F0075002000770061006E007400200074006F002000740061006B0065002000610020006D006F006D0065006E007400200074006F00200063006800650063006B00200074006800650020007000720069006300650073000A006F006600200074006800650020006900740065006D0073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
